  "title": "Bank7 Corp. Announces Agreement to Acquire Controlling Interest in Centruy Financial Services Corporation",
  "summary": "OKLAHOMA CITY, July 2, 2026 — Bank7 Corp. (NASDAQ: BSVN) (the “Company”), the parent company of Oklahoma City-based Bank7, today announced that it has entered into a definitive Stock Purchase Agreement to acquire an approximately 71% controlling ownership interest in Century Financial Services Corporation (“Century”), the Santa Fe, New Mexico-based bank holding company for Century […]",
